  designNotes: '2026-09-02 (續71) HEAD-SCISSOR COMMAND GRAB. Meshy PW2 Jumping_Head_Scissor_Takedown
    (3.67s). 續69 collider window never connected (feet ~2m up when inverted). 續70 used
    commandGrab + useRootMotion - but the clip bakes ~380deg of body spin into the ROOT
    (avgAngularSpeed 1.8), so applying deltaPosition (position-only) made the forward
    travel curl through the spin and cancel out => 屁孩王 "spun in place in the air".
    續71: useRootMotion OFF, code-driven lunge instead - lungeDistanceFromTargetGap=1,
    lungeTargetGapMeters 0.6, lungeMaxMeters 13, attackMotion nt 0.12-0.45. BeginAttack
    locks the gap at cast and drives the root straight along the committed direction, so
    the clip''s spin stays purely visual. commandGrab=1: BossStateMachine does ONE
    horizontal proximity test at commandGrabNormalized 0.45 (the clinch), within
    commandGrabRadius 2.5m applies this asset''s numbers directly: baseHealthDamage 38,
    basePoiseDamage 200 (guaranteed stagger = 跩起來/held), knockbackForce 11 +
    launchesTarget 1 (up-launch + hard fling = 反向甩出擊飛, along the commit dir).
    lateTracking 0.25 + trackingDrop 0.4 keep the clinch yawed at the player; pitch 15
    leans down. Gap-closer path now also accepts LungeDistanceFromTargetGap attacks (not
    just UseRootMotion). 屁孩王-only. NO true socket grab-lock (player knocked, not
    parented) - bigger follow-up. NEEDS PLAY TUNING (radius / grab nt / lunge speed).'
